BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (or revenue exists yet. If an API closes or access terms change, switch to scheduled bulk FOIA/public-record) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (exports, official data feeds, and low-frequency cached queues. Under 5 U.S.C. ? 552, request existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (agency records; disclosure exemptions and processing delays mean FOIA is neither unrestricted access nor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (an instant substitute for client records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (Apply sector-specific evidence and communication rules before expanding outreach volume. Manufacturing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (drawback needs production traceability; resellers need possession and export evidence; related-party) Tj ET
